An independent fan project. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by Valve.
Portal 2 is not included: nothing from the game is in this repository, and the
crates only read the files of the player's own copy of Portal 2, on their own
machine. Behaviour was worked out from the user's own copy of the game and
written up as plain-English notes; no Valve code is in this repository.

